[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6663.03, "timestamp": "01:51:03", "text": "类似的东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6665.27, "timestamp": "01:51:05", "text": "那么，拉弥亚社会是如何运作的呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6667.51, "timestamp": "01:51:07", "text": "将在类似这样的现场环境下工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6670.39, "timestamp": "01:51:10", "text": "如果有一个穆斯林拉弥亚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6673.23, "timestamp": "01:51:13", "text": "她穿了什么衣服？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6675.229, "timestamp": "01:51:15", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6679.43, "timestamp": "01:51:19", "text": "啊，问得好。现在我可以了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6682.55, "timestamp": "01:51:22", "text": "感觉我仿佛看到了自己想象中的那个场景"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6685.99, "timestamp": "01:51:25", "text": "将会怎样呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6689.27, "timestamp": "01:51:29", "text": "但这说不通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6691.55, "timestamp": "01:51:31", "text": "当你……哦，是的。并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6694.31, "timestamp": "01:51:34", "text": "等待。是的。当熔岩移动时，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6696.87, "timestamp": "01:51:36", "text": "会毁了裙子。是的，这会毁了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6698.87, "timestamp": "01:51:38", "text": "那件裙子。所以，你会做一个大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6706.95, "timestamp": "01:51:46", "text": "嗯？那么，这种材料就必须是独一无二的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6713.03, "timestamp": "01:51:53", "text": "我们需要找个做衣服的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6714.39, "timestamp": "01:51:54", "text": "关于这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6717.95, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "text": "对，就像雇佣一个能制作……的人。"}]